        # If swapping them sorts, answer YES. If swapping them does not sort, then you need more than one swap, answer NO.
        # So mismatches == 2 does not guarantee YES. So we cannot assert. We'll skip this test.
        # Instead we only assert for mismatches == 0.
        if mismatches == 0:
            assert output == 'YES', 'Zero mismatches must output YES'

